      "widgets_values": [
        "Fourpanel comics,manga,colored\n\nPanel 1 (Top Left):\nA bright, sunny day in a small town park,A cheerful, young girl with short brown hair wearing a yellow dress, holding a red balloon,The girl is smiling and looking at the balloon.A text buddle on her head says:\"What a beautiful day!\"\n\nPanel 2 (Top Right):\nThe same park, a gentle breeze blows,The same girl, still holding the balloon, but the balloon is starting to lift,The girl looks surprised as the balloon starts to float away,A text buddle on her head says:\"Oh no, my balloon!\"\n\nPanel 3 (Bottom Left):\nThe balloon is high up in the sky, floating away,The girl looks up, worried, and a friendly dog with a leash appears beside her,The dog is jumping up, trying to reach the balloon. text buddle on her head says:\"Can you catch it, boy?\"\n\nPanel 4 (Bottom Right):\nThe dog successfully catches the string of the balloon in mid-air,The girl smiles widely, holding the balloon again, and the dog sits happily beside her.The girl pats the dog on the head.text buddle on her head says:\"Thank you, you're the best!\"",
        "Fourpanel comics,manga,colored\n\nPanel 1 (Top Left):\nA bright, sunny day in a small town park,A cheerful, young girl with short brown hair wearing a yellow dress, holding a red balloon,The girl is smiling and looking at the balloon.A text buddle on her head says:\"What a beautiful day!\"\n\nPanel 2 (Top Right):\nThe same park, a gentle breeze blows,The same girl, still holding the balloon, but the balloon is starting to lift,The girl looks surprised as the balloon starts to float away,A text buddle on her head says:\"Oh no, my balloon!\"\n\nPanel 3 (Bottom Left):\nThe balloon is high up in the sky, floating away,The girl looks up, worried, and a friendly dog with a leash appears beside her,The dog is jumping up, trying to reach the balloon. text buddle on her head says:\"Can you catch it, boy?\"\n\nPanel 4 (Bottom Right):\nThe dog successfully catches the string of the balloon in mid-air,The girl smiles widely, holding the balloon again, and the dog sits happily beside her.The girl pats the dog on the head.text buddle on her head says:\"Thank you, you're the best!\"",
        4
